 7700 CPU was power efficient at 90w max draw and paired well with the RTX 3070 for 1440p gaming. The ID-Cooling SE-207-SE cooler maintained excellent thermals throughout all workloads. Build time was approximately 20 minutes. Case panel quality is decent but thin, requiring careful handling. No dedicated top or bottom fan support in this configuration, but airflow remains adequate with the 92mm Noctua exhaust fan. This is a good productivity and gaming system in a compact form factor. Case requires regular cleaning due to lack of fine mesh filtration.\\\"}]]}]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1b:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"space-y-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"rounded-2xl border border-line bg-surface p-5 space-y-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-base font-semibold text-ink\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Performance\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xs text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wide font-medium mb-1\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"CPU — CB23 Multi\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-2xl font-bold text-ink tabular-nums\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"18,433\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-1.5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex-1 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface-alt overflow-hidden\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"h-full rounded-full bg-accent\\\",\\\"style\\\":{\\\"width\\\":\\\"69%\\\"}}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xs text-ink-muted tabular-nums w-12 text-right\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"top \\\",31,\\\"%\\\"]}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex gap-4 text-xs text-ink-muted mt-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\